            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Terrace Cafe",
            "review_text": "James & Amanda\nBrisbane, Australia170 contributions\n0\nGreat cafe with a view\nMay 2019 • Couples\nWe stopped in for a light bite and a few drinks. Service was wonderful and we had a great view of the Opera House upstairs. \nFood was very nice and reasonably priced considering it was in an air conditioned building with such a great location. Highly recommend as a quiet place to stop and soak up Hoi An and the view of the Opera House.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 16, 2019",
