            "review_text": "Art R\nPotomac, Maryland6 contributions\n0\nInexpensive, but not worth it\nMar 2017 • Business\nStaying at the Metropole,we just wanted an inexpensive lunch when we arrived. This place had good, albeit, generally older reviews. Wanted a simple tuna salad, but without the lettuce and tomato (for health reasons) and an Asian chicken/rice dish. Tuna came with the lettuce and tomato anyway, but virtually NO tuna.\nThe chicken was better - but only marginally so.\nManager was very involved and did comp the tuna, but we still cannot recommend. Language may have been a factor in the lettuce and tomato concern, but not the fact that actual tuna was a no show.\nRead more\nWritten March 3, 2017",
