            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Terrace Cafe",
            "review_text": "a-travelin-foodie\nUnited States1074 contributions\n0\nAt Conifer Hotel - relaxing and good food\nDec 2016 • Couples\nThis came recommended by our Vietnamese guide. Outdoor seating. They start you off with a plate of Spanish peanuts. Good pho. Yummy spring rolls with banana and shrimp. Stir fried egg noodles with seafood not great; seemed like used packaged ramen - a rookie move on our part, should have stuck to rice. Decent prices.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 21, 2017",
