            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Terrace Cafe",
            "review_text": "Gary M\nMontreal, Canada318 contributions\n0\nA wonderfully relaxing terrace for drinks or a light meal\nDec 2016 • Couples\nWe went to the terrace a few times for lunch and then for drinks. Just a short walk from the Sofitel Metropole, the Opera House and some great shops. Service was friendly and the food/drinks were both good and reasonably priced. Even had a shoe shine while drinking a local beer. \n\nIt appears to be a favorite spot for the well-heeled locals driving up in their Mercedes, BMWs etc.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 14, 2017",
