            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Terrace Cafe",
            "review_text": "NguyenThang2511\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat location\nSep 2015 • Friends\nOrdering the delicious Vietnamese, we really enjoy the meal at this terrace restaurant, which is belong to Conifer Boutique Hotel. Excellent service and food. Moreover, the location is very good. We will go back again\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 27, 2015\nTerrace C\nDear NguyenThang2511,\nWe are so delightful that you had a great time at our Hanoi Terrace Cafe. Thank you very much for your great comment on our food quality and our fantastic location and great atmosphere. At our Hanoi Terrace Cafe, our Chef always does his best to create a great flavour with traditional way that make our guest has a wonderful feeling and truly relaxing.\nWe do our best to make a great time to our guest.\n\nBest regards,\n\nPeter Xuan (Mr.)\nGeneral Manager\nMobile: 84 964 25 6666\nEmail: gm@coniferhotel.com.vn\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
