            "review_text": "Tùng Đ\n1 contribution\n0\nThis place is excellent\nSep 2015 • Friends\nI would say that i was pretty impressed by the taste of the Vietnamese coffee there and also the view from the front of the shop is awesome, it was a wonderful experience chilling in this place\nWritten September 23, 2015\nTerrace C\nDear Tung,\nThank you very much for taking time to share your comment on our Hanoi Terrace Cafe which belongs to our Conifer Boutique Hotel managed by H & K Hospitality.\nWe are so happy that you enjoyed the food at our restaurant. We stay at any moment to make our guest happy and enjoy the spirits of Vietnamese food.\nWe are looking forward to welcome you back at your next visit.\n\nBest regards,\n\nPeter Xuan ( Mr.)\nGeneral Manager\nMobile: +84 964 25 6666\nEmail: gm@coniferhotel.com.vn\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
